# Gradle daemon JVM criteria.
#
# This pins the JVM that RUNS Gradle — the one that loads the fabric-loom /
# ModDevGradle plugin classes, whose published module metadata requires a
# Java 21+ runtime. With this file present, Gradle auto-detects a matching
# installed JDK for the build JVM even when JAVA_HOME points at an older
# one. Compile/test toolchains are a separate mechanism: they are
# provisioned per subproject by the foojay resolver convention, which can
# NOT satisfy this launch-JVM requirement.
#
# Regenerate with: ./gradlew updateDaemonJvm --jvm-version={{java_version_daemon}}
toolchainVersion={{java_version_daemon}}
